# Intentionally ignores nothing. track_in_git is true for this board.
#
# Do not delete: analyze_pcb.py recreates a .gitignore that ignores the whole
# directory whenever this file is ABSENT, without checking track_in_git the way
# analyze_schematic.py and analysis_cache.ensure_analysis_dir both do. Leaving a
# harmless file here is what keeps analysis output tracked.
